1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,750
Aw, it's just Iike my grandma
with her parrot.

2
00:00:04,087 --> 00:00:07,337
(Bernadette:)And after she lost her marbles,
with her remote control.

3
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:13,887
(Sheldon:)My phone's on the desk over there.
Take a picture of us together.

4
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:17,765
(Sheldon:)Make it good enough to go on a mug,
a mouse pad and a calendar.

5
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:26,151
(Sheldon:)If you were a dove,
I'd call you Lovey Dovey.

6
00:00:26,317 --> 00:00:30,407
(Sheldon:)Oh, who am I kidding? This isn't a moment
for strict adherence to the literal.

7
00:00:30,572 --> 00:00:33,322
You're just my little Lovey Dovey,
aren't you?

8
00:00:34,784 --> 00:00:38,584
I guess you gotta have hollow bones
to get some sugar around here.

9
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:43,502
(Bernadette:)I still think
he looks like someone's pet.

10
00:00:43,668 --> 00:00:45,208
(Bernadette:)Maybe we should put up posters.

11
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:48,628
(Sheldon:)Yes, it should have a big picture of him
and the words:

12
00:00:48,798 --> 00:00:52,428
"ls this your bird? Not anymore."

13
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:56,469
We're gonna have
so much fun together.

14
00:00:56,639 --> 00:00:59,019
(Sheldon:)You can carry messages
to all my enemies.

